s, candidates, applications, interview details, and final offer statuses. Each table is interconnected, allowing for comprehensive analyses of recruitment metrics and candidate journey stages. The data modeled here can help hiring managers and HR professionals identify bottlenecks, evaluate candidate performance, and enhance decision-making in the recruitment process. The dataset is synthetic, designed for testing and analytical purposes, and provides an ideal platform for practicing SQL queries and building BI dashboards.","url":"https://databasesample.com/datasets/recruiting-pipeline","identifier":"https://databasesample.com/datasets/recruiting-pipeline","version":"4","inLanguage":"en","license":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","isAccessibleForFree":true,"keywords":["recruitment","candidates","job openings","applications","interviews","offers","HR","pipeline","HR","Transactional (OLTP)","Test fixtures","BI dashboards"],"creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Database Sample","url":"https://databasesample.com"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Database Sample","url":"https://databasesample.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-07","dateModified":"2026-09-11","includedInDataCatalog":{"@type":"DataCatalog","@id":"https://databasesample.com/datasets#catalog","name":"Database Sample Datasets","url":"https://databasesample.com/datasets"},"variableMeasured":[{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"job_openings.id","description":"Unique identifier for the job opening."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"job_openings.title","description":"Title of the job opening."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"job_openings.department","description":"Department where the job opening is located."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"job_openings.created_at","description":"Date and time when the job opening was created."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"job_openings.status","description":"Current status of the job opening."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"candidates.id","description":"Unique identifier for the candidate."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"candidates.full_name","description":"Full name of the candidate."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"candidates.email","description":"Email address of the candidate."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"candidates.applied_at","description":"Date and time when the candidate applied."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"applications.id","description":"Unique identifier for the application."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"applications.candidate_id","description":"Reference to the candidate applying."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"applications.job_opening_id","description":"Reference to the job opening applied for."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"applications.status","description":"Current status of the application."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"applications.applied_at","description":"Date of application."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"applications.application_date","description":"Date when the application was submitted."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"applications.interview_count","description":"Number of interviews conducted for this application."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"applications.candidate_rating","description":"Rating given to the candidate by the interviewer; null if not rated."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"interviews.id","description":"Unique identifier for the interview."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"interviews.application_id","description":"Reference to the application being interviewed."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"interviews.interviewer","description":"Name of the interviewer conducting the interview."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"interviews.score","description":"Score given by the interviewer for the interview."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"interviews.interviewed_at","description":"Date and time of the interview."},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"offers.id","description":"Unique identifier for the offer."},{"@type":"